<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Niagara Mohawk cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Niagara Mohawk cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it had cut its rating for Niagara Mohawk Power Corp to market perform from trading buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the New York utility opened down 3/8 to 9-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
